{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"064b75400ace0710e85303ab993a16d8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## macOS Terminal.app .terminal plist 文件格式\n\n### 关键字段结构\n\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">\n<plist version=\"1.0\">\n<dict>\n    <key>name</key>\n    <string>My Custom Profile</string>\n\n    <key>ProfileCurrentVersion</key>\n    <real>1.0</real>\n\n    <key>Font</key>\n    <dict>\n        <key>AFRF</key>\n        <string>MesloLGS-Nerd-Font-Mono</string>\n        <key>NSFontSize</key>\n        <real>13</real>\n    </dict>\n\n    <key>ANSIColors</key>\n    <dict>\n        <key>AnsiBlackColor</key>\n        <dict>\n            <key>Alpha Component</key><real>1</real>\n            <key>Red Component</key><real>0.3</real>\n            <key>Green Component</key><real>0.3</real>\n            <key>Blue Component</key><real>0.3</real>\n        </dict>\n        <!-- AnsiRed, AnsiGreen, AnsiYellow, AnsiBlue, AnsiMagenta, AnsiCyan, AnsiWhite 同理 -->\n    </dict>\n\n    <key>TextColor</key>\n    <dict>\n        <key>Alpha Component</key><real>1</real>\n        <key>Red Component</key><real>0.9</real>\n        <key>Green Component</key><real>0.9</real>\n        <key>Blue Component</key><real>0.9</real>\n    </dict>\n\n    <key>BackgroundColor</key>\n    <dict>\n        <key>Alpha Component</key><real>1</real>\n        <key>Red Component</key><real>0.1</real>\n        <key>Green Component</key><real>0.1</real>\n        <key>Blue Component</key><real>0.15</real>\n    </dict>\n\n    <key>CursorColor</key>\n    <dict>\n        <key>Alpha Component</key><real>1</real>\n        <key>Red Component</key><real>0.0</real>\n        <key>Green Component</key><real>0.8</real>\n        <key>Blue Component</key><real>0.2</real>\n    </dict>\n</dict>\n</plist>\n```\n\n---\n\n### `open <file.terminal>` 导入后出现在哪里\n\n导入后的 profile 存在两个地方：\n\n| 存储位置 | 说明 |\n|----------|------|\n| `~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.Terminal.plist` | 历史兼容，旧的存储方式 |\n| `~/Library/Containers/com.apple.Terminal/Data/Library/Preferences/com.apple.Terminal.plist` | macOS 沙箱化后的实际存储位置 |\n\nTerminal.app 启动时从后者读取。**profiles 不会单独存成 .plist 文件**，而是作为一个 `profiles` dict 合并进 Terminal 的 preference plist 中。\n\n验证命令：\n\n```bash\n# 查看 Terminal 已加载的所有 profile 名称\ndefaults read com.apple.Terminal.plist 2>/dev/null | \\\n  grep -A1 \"ProfileCurrentVersion\" | head -20\n\n# 或者用 PlistBuddy 更精确地列出 profile 列表\n/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy -c \"Print :profiles\" \\\n  ~/Library/Containers/com.apple.Terminal/Data/Library/Preferences/com.apple.Terminal.plist 2>/dev/null\n\n# 查看某个具体 profile 的内容（如 \"My Custom Profile\"）\n/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy -c \"Print :profiles:MyCustomProfile\" \\\n  ~/Library/Containers/com.apple.Terminal/Data/Library/Preferences/com.apple.Terminal.plist 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n---\n\n### 设置默认 Profile\n\n需要 **两个** key 配合：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 设置新建窗口默认使用的 profile（推荐）\ndefaults write com.apple.Terminal \"Default Window Settings\" -string \"My Custom Profile\"\n\n# 2. 设置全局默认（对所有新开的窗口生效）\ndefaults write com.apple.Terminal NSGlobalDomain \"Window Settings\" -dict-add \"My Custom Profile\" \"$(defaults read com.apple.Terminal 'Window Settings' 2>/dev/null || echo '{}')\"\n\n# 刷新 preference 缓存（立即生效）\nkillall SystemPreferences 2>/dev/null || true\n```\n\n验证命令：\n\n```bash\n# 确认默认窗口设置\ndefaults read com.apple.Terminal \"Default Window Settings\"\n\n# 确认 profile 确实存在（打印第一个 key 即可）\ndefaults read com.apple.Terminal.plist 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"^    [a-zA-Z]\" | head -5\n```\n\n**注意**：`open <file.terminal>` 导入后，还需要手动在 Terminal > Settings > Profiles 里把它设为 Default，或者用上述 `defaults write` 命令设置为默认。导入本身**不会**自动把它变成默认。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":159,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21500,"cache_read_input_tokens":25668},"service_tier":"standard","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d886635e-62c1-4dc0-aeb6-be9992ce5ed5","uuid":"d0303322-2c68-4886-a739-bafede04005f"}
